      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2d19d0a2990547bfc05f3a|full_name} open hand when in steam overlay has been a thing for many years though for other controllers..\n\nwhen you let go of other controllers the gesture becomes open hand, which makes it make the most sense for if afk or otherwise occupied.",
